Title: Last Train
Credit: Example scene
Author: Summer Rise Studios
Notes: Written for the Frame prototype. Free to use for testing.

EXT. RAILWAY PLATFORM, WARANGAL - NIGHT

Rain hammers a tin roof. The platform is empty except for a chai stall with one bulb still burning.

LAKSHMI (60s), the stall owner, wipes down glasses she has already wiped twice.

ARJUN (20s), soaked, a guitar case on his back, runs in and stops under the roof.

ARJUN
The 11:40 to Hyderabad?

LAKSHMI
Left at 11:40.

Arjun looks at the empty track. He sets the guitar case down and sits on it.

LAKSHMI (CONT'D)
Next one is at five. Chai?

ARJUN
(counting coins)
I've got twelve rupees.

She is already pouring.

LAKSHMI
Then it's a twelve-rupee chai.

He laughs for the first time. The bulb flickers.

CUT TO:
